message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Piezo: A Protocol-Free Gateway for Agent-Driven Engineering Solvers with Live Log Telemetry"
abstract: "A small gateway that lets an LLM agent (or any script) launch a command-line numerical solver, watch its log as structured events while it runs, and stop it, over plain local HTTP or a JavaScript API, with no MCP server and no SDK."
authors:
  - family-names: Nissanka
    given-names: Madeesh P.
license: MIT
